# Router-Only Pages Rule

- Keep `src/pages` as a routing layer only.
- Do not place business logic, feature state, or large JSX structures in `src/pages`.
- Route files should import and render/export screen components from `src/ui/components/**`.
- Auth gates use `getServerSideProps` from `@lib/auth/withAuthSSR` or `withPublicSSR` (see `nextjs-ssr-server-secrets.mdc`).

## Expected Pattern

```tsx
import { PatientPage } from "@ui/components/patient/PatientPage";
import { withAuthSSR } from "@lib/auth/withAuthSSR";

export const getServerSideProps = withAuthSSR({ role: "patient" });

export default PatientPage;
```
